#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:54
msgid "Zenodo Community ID"
msgstr "ID de la comunitat de Zenodo"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:55
msgid ""
"Short string identifying which Zenodo community to import from. Found in URL"
" after https://zenodo.org/communities/ and before any search parameters. "
"Example: lory_hslu"
msgstr ""
"Cadena curta que identifica de quina comunitat de Zenodo importar. Es troba "
"disponible a l'URL després de https://zenodo.org/communities/ i abans de "
"qualsevol paràmetre de cerca. Per exemple: lory:hslu"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:67 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:72
msgid "Metadata format"
msgstr "Format de metadades"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:68
msgid ""
"Select the metadata format to export from Zenodo. NOTE: Ensure the format "
"exists as a vocabulary in your Omeka instance."
msgstr ""
"Seleccioneu el format de metadades a exportar des de Zenodo. NOTA: "
"Assegureu-vos que el format existeix com a vocabulari a la vostra instància "
"d'Omeka."

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:93 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:96
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:95 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:105
msgid "Test import"
msgstr "Prova d'importació"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:94
msgid ""
"If checked, ONLY import the first 25 results. Useful for testing and fine-"
"tuning."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:106 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:109
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:108 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:118
msgid "Import files into Omeka S"
msgstr "Importa els fitxers a l'Omeka S"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:107 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:110
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:109 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:119
msgid ""
"If checked, all data files associated with a record will be imported into "
"Omeka S."
msgstr ""
"Si se selecciona, tots els fitxers de dades associats al registre "
"s'importaran a l'Omeka S."

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:119 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:122
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:121 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:131
msgid "A note about the purpose or source of this import."
msgstr "Una nota sobre la finalitat o font d'aquesta importació."

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:142 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:145
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:144 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:154
msgid "Assign a resource template to all imported resources."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:153 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:156
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:155 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:165
msgid "Select item set(s)"
msgstr "Seleccioneu els conjunts d'ítems"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:159 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:162
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:161 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:171
msgid "Optional. Import items into item set(s)."
msgstr "Opcional. Importa recursos dins d'un conjunt(s) de recursos."

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:183 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:186
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:185 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:195
msgid "Select site(s)"
msgstr "Selecioneu el lloc/s"

#: src/Form/ZenodoForm.php:189 src/Form/InvenioForm.php:192
#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:191 src/Form/DataverseForm.php:201
msgid "Optional. Import items into site(s)."
msgstr "Opcional. Importa recursos dins d'un lloc(s)."

#: src/Form/InvenioForm.php:55
msgid "Main Invenio URL"
msgstr "URL principal de l'Invenio"

#: src/Form/InvenioForm.php:56
msgid ""
"Base URL of the Invenio site. Example: <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"http://opendata.cern.ch\">http://opendata.cern.ch</a>"
msgstr ""
"URL base del lloc web Invenio. Per exemple: <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"http://opendata.cern.ch\">http://opendata.cern.ch</a>"

#: src/Form/InvenioForm.php:69
msgid "Search Query"
msgstr "Consulta"

#: src/Form/InvenioForm.php:70
msgid ""
"Filter records using <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-"
"dsl-query-string-query.html#query-string-syntax\">ElasticSearch query "
"syntax</a>. Examples: \"oceanography\", \"access_right:open\""
msgstr ""
"Filtra els registres utilitzant la <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-"
"dsl-query-string-query.html#query-string-syntax\">sintaxi de consulta "
"ElasticSearch</a>. Per exemple: \"oceanography\", \"access_right:open\""

#: src/Form/InvenioForm.php:83
msgid ""
"The maximum number of results to retrieve at once from Invenio instance. If "
"you notice errors or missing data, try lowering this number. Increasing it "
"might make imports faster."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de resultats a recuperar a la vegada de la instància "
"d'Invenio. Si noteu errors o dades que manquen, proveu de baixar aquest "
"número. Augmentar-ho podria fer que les importacions fossin més ràpides."

#: src/Form/InvenioForm.php:97 src/Form/CKANForm.php:96
#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:106
msgid ""
"If checked, ONLY import the # of results indicated in Limit field above. "
"Useful for testing and fine-tuning."
msgstr ""
"Si està marcada, NOMÉS importarà el nombre de resultats indicats al camp "
"Límit anterior. És d'utilitat per fer proves."

#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:55
msgid "Main CKAN URL"
msgstr "URL principal de CKAN"

#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:56
msgid ""
"URL of the main CKAN site. Requires <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://docs.ckan.org/projects/ckanext-"
"dcat/en/latest/endpoints/\">RDF-DCAT plugin</a>. Example: <a "
"target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://open.canada.ca/data/en/\">https://open.canada.ca/data/en/</a>"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:69
msgid "CKAN Organization"
msgstr "CKAN Organization"

#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:70
msgid ""
"The identifier of the CKAN organization to import from. Example: cdic-sadc. "
"If organization field is blank, all datasets under Main CKAN URL above will "
"be imported."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/CKANForm.php:82
msgid ""
"The maximum number of results to retrieve at once from CKAN instance. If you"
" notice errors or missing data, try lowering this number. Increasing it "
"might make imports faster."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de resultats a recuperar a la vegada de la instància CKAN. "
"Si noteu errors o dades que manquen, proveu de baixar aquest número. "
"Augmentar-ho podria fer que les importacions fossin més ràpides."

#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:45
msgid "Main Dataverse URL"
msgstr "URL principal de Dataverse"

#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:46
msgid ""
"URL of the main Dataverse site. Example: <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://dataverse.harvard.edu\">https://dataverse.harvard.edu</a>"
msgstr ""
"URL del lloc web principal de Dataverse. Per exemple: <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://dataverse.harvard.edu\">https://dataverse.harvard.edu</a>"

#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:59
msgid "Dataverse Identifier"
msgstr "Identificador Dataverse"

#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:60
msgid ""
"The identifier of the Dataverse to import from. Listed at end of URL. "
"Example: \"odas\" from <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://dataverse.harvard.edu/dataverse/odas\">https://dataverse.harvard.edu/dataverse/odas</a>."
" If blank, all datasets under Main Dataverse URL above will be imported."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:73
msgid ""
"Select the metadata format to export from Dataverse. NOTE: Ensure the format"
" exists as a vocabulary in your Omeka instance."
msgstr ""
"Seleccioneu el format de metadades a exportar des de Dataverse. NOTA: "
"Assegureu-vos que el format existeix com a vocabulari a la vostra instància "
"d'Omeka."

#: src/Form/DataverseForm.php:92
msgid ""
"The maximum number of results to retrieve at once from Dataverse. If you "
"notice errors or missing data, try lowering this number. Increasing it might"
" make imports faster."
msgstr ""
"El nombre màxim de resultats a recuperar a la vegada des de Dataverse. Si "
"noteu errors o dades que manquen, proveu de baixar aquest número. Augmentar-"
"ho podria fer que les importacions fossin més ràpides."

